# Context index

| Area | Read this first | Use when |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Overall project | `AGENTS.md`, `docs/project/PROJECT_PROFILE.md` | Starting any material task |
| Product behavior | `docs/specs/` | Clarifying what must be true |
| Implementation | `docs/plans/` | Changing an approved feature |
| Decisions | `docs/project/DECISIONS.md` | A prior choice affects work |
| Operations | `docs/runbooks/` | Running, verifying or releasing a service |

Add project-specific entries only after their sources are confirmed.
